Z||000006||Monkeyman||01-15-2000||06:21 PM||||Whew!  Probably too far for me.  I'm still for the Indy thing in June.  Much closer.  My wife manages a motel and can't always get 2 full days off in a row.  If we did the Indy thing, my wife and I could come down one morning and return home the next afternoon.  That way we wouldn't be spending all of our time driving.  Of course, nobody's actually invited me yet!||||reg||1
