Z||000009||2M4 Dale||01-15-2000||11:50 PM||||Once we figure out what time we need to meet, before the race, I figured that maybe the Richland Mall might be a good place to start from. It's easy to find for the out-of-towners.And just enough of a drive from MID-OHIO to make it feel like a little cruise. But the McDonalds idea would work too. Any other thoughts ? Chad Man, I do live in Mansfield and the telephone is local for me so let me know what I can do! ||||reg||3
