Z||000044||ChadMan||05-30-2000||10:19 AM||||Come one, come all!  Got an email from Cleveland Fieros this morning - they have "plenty" of cars coming and don't need any more names ahead of time.<P>This means you don't have to pre-register - you can just show up in the Fiero corral with your Fiero Sunday morning, and as long as you're there in time to sign the waiver (say, before 10:30 am), you'll get to take the parade laps!<P>This event will go on rain or shine (though obviously attendance will be down if it rains...)||||reg||1
