Z||000066||87ECO5||06-25-2000||10:11 PM||||<B>AWESOME!!!!!</B>  That's all I have to say - <B>TOTALLY AWESOME!!!!!</B> ... (like, oh me gawd!)    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Seriously though, other than the weather (and my car throwing a code during the trip up and back), the day was perfect!  Lots of cars (including 10 Fieros) and great people!<P>And, did I mention the parade laps!!!???  Of course, I'm not sure I'd call them parade laps.  I think I heard ChadMan say he got his coupe up around 70 in one of the straights!  Fast parade!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I just wanna say thanks!  The only way it could have been better is if FieroWife could have been there to enjoy it with me!||||reg||14
